OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor who lost mum to
OL,4,Aalcoholism calls for more sober
OL,5,Anightlife
OL,6,
OL,7,FA councillor who lost her mother to
OL,8,Falcoholism has said Liverpool needs to
OL,9,Fembrace more sober nightlife - and
OL,10,Fchampioned a plan by the city to do
OL,11,Fmore to tackle binge drinking culture.
OL,13,FThe Green Party's Shantelle Lund said
OL,14,Fthere have been too many hospital
OL,15,Fadmissions due to alcohol and called
OL,16,Fhas called for more non-alcohol
OL,17,Fnightlife alternatives.
